      <p>The editor's UI menus, the command line, and the MCP server for agents all run the exact same commands.</p>
      <h2 id="the-project-is-the-unit" class="group scroll-mt-20">The project is the unit<a href="#the-project-is-the-unit" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
